# --- Secrets: these should ONLY ever exist as environment variables,
# never as files -- this is a second line of defense, not the primary
# control, since the primary control is "never write them to a file
# at all" (see launcher_listener.py / graph_sync.py's own docstrings)
.env
*.pem
*.key

# --- Large model binaries -- exceed or approach GitHub's file-size
# comfort zone, and don't belong in git history regardless of size.
# Document a separate download step instead (see SETUP.md).
pretrained_models/
yolov8n.pt
*.pt
*.faiss

# --- Standard Python ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
